{
    "title": "True Religion | Since 2002",
    "description": "Premium denim rooted in streetwear, now with a mobile shopping experience that fits in our signature back pocket. Download the True Religion app and enjoy exclusive access to official drops, quality signature stitch denim, graphic tees, active sets, accessories, everyday jeans, and so much more. Even better, you can enjoy easy access to our exclusive denim deals and save big when you upgrade your streetwear wardrobe. Did we mention that you'll be among the first to know about new product launches and collaborations? \r\n\r\nInstant Wardrobe Refresh\r\n\r\nYour new wardrobe is just a click away. Whether you are shopping for a pair of men\u2019s or women\u2019s denim jeans, tees, joggers, sweatshirts, accessories, or streetwear essentials to add to your collection, True Religion has got you. Browse our selection of quality denim, streetwear, and accessories anytime, anywhere, and take advantage of our free shipping on all orders over $150.\r\n\r\nTrue Fam Loyalty Program\r\n\r\nTrue Rewards designed exclusively for you. Level up with every purchase and get the star-studded treatment you deserve. Earn points for every $1 spent, receive a birthday reward each year, gain early access to sales and much more.  \r\n\r\nBeen That Stitch\r\n\r\nElevate your denim collection with a new pair of True Religion jeans, always complete with our signature touch and recognizable stitch. We carry men\u2019s and women\u2019s denim jeans in various styles, washes, and fits. If you're looking for something bold, shop from our iconic Super T stitch selection. Complete your streetwear look with a classic logo tee or with one of our denim jackets because why not?\r\n\r\nTrue Religion denim and streetwear clothing is made to be worn religiously and authentically. Are you up for it? Download our app for an unbeatable mobile shopping experience. You deserve it.",
